I take my heavy suitcase out.
I bring it into the corridor.
My small bag is placed on the suitcase.
My neighbor Asha is standing near the door.
Asha smiles and helps me.
She takes my small bag in her hand.
She says, "Maya, I will take this bag."
I thank Asha.
I pull my big suitcase.
We walk together in the corridor.
My new flat is in this same building.
It is on this same floor.
Asha is a very good neighbor.
My new flat is quite near now.
We stop in front of the new door.
I feel very happy.
